   0   3.90   4.38   3.43  1.00  It's a sunny day at the park! And look, there's a new friend!
   1   8.33   4.86   4.11  1.00  Hi! I'm Lily! I'm building the biggest sandcastle in the whole park!
   2  13.24   3.53   2.38  1.00  Pat, pat, pat! Scoop, scoop, scoop!
   3  16.82   3.12   2.57  1.00  Here comes Mila, with a basket of apples.
