  11  46.71   4.05   3.30  1.00  Huff, puff! This box is so heavy! Can somebody help me?
  12  50.81   2.72   1.57  1.00  I'm busy, Bobo!
  13  53.58   4.99   3.54  1.00  Mila, Leo and Bobo feel sad. Nobody helped them.
  14  58.62   6.62   2.07  1.00  Hmm. Was Lily being a good friend?
  15  65.29   4.75   3.60  1.00  Not really. She was so busy, she forgot about her friends.
  16  70.09   7.24   6.69  1.00  Then... a big gust of wind! Whoosh! Lily's bucket and spade blow away, and her castle falls down!
  17  77.38   2.90   2.15  1.00  Oh no! My castle! My bucket!
  18  80.33   3.39   2.24  1.00  I can't fix it all by myself!
  19  83.77   2.43   1.88  1.00  Don't worry, Lily! We'll help you!
  20  86.25   2.00   1.45  1.00  I'll catch the bucket!
  21  88.30   2.02   1.27  1.00  And I'll find the spade!
  22  90.37   5.52   4.37  1.00  Everybody helps. Pat, pat, scoop! The castle is back, even bigger!
  23  95.94   4.09   3.34  1.00  You helped me... but I didn't help you. Why did you help me?
  24 100.08   2.98   1.83  1.00  Because friends help friends!
  25 103.11   4.40   3.45  1.00  I'm sorry. I was too busy. I want to help too! But how?
  26 107.56   5.52   4.77  1.00  Hoo hoo! I can show you, Lily! Helping is easy, in three little steps.
  27 113.13   5.42   4.47  1.00  Step one: Look. Look around. Does a friend have a problem? Are they sad?
  28 118.60   5.81   2.86  1.00  Can you look around with big eyes? Look, look!
  29 124.46   3.74   2.79  1.00  Step two: Ask. Say, can I help you?
  30 128.25   4.89   1.94  1.00  Can you say it? Can I help you?
  31 133.19   4.25   3.30  1.00  Step three: Help! Do a little thing to make it better.
  32 137.49   5.31   2.36  1.00  Can you give a big thumbs up? Let's help!
  33 142.85   3.49   2.04  1.00  Look. Ask. Help. I can do it!
  34 146.39   3.19   2.24  1.00  Let's practise! What can we do to help?
  35 149.63   7.19   4.24  1.00  A friend dropped her crayons. Can you pick them up? Pick, pick, pick!
  36 156.87   2.06   1.11  1.00  Great helping!
  37 158.98   5.93   2.98  1.00  A friend is sad. Can you give a big, warm hug?
  38 164.96   2.61   1.66  1.00  Aww! What a lovely hug!
  39 167.62   7.55   4.60  1.00  A friend's tower fell down. Can you build it up again? Stack, stack, stack!
  40 175.22   3.24   1.79  1.00  Oops! I'm hugging the tower! Hee hee!
  41 178.51   6.89   3.94  1.00  And a friend is sitting all alone. Can you wave and say, come and play?
  42 185.45   2.94   1.49  1.00  Come and play with us!
  43 188.44   3.10   2.15  1.00  Now, Lily wants to help her friends.
  44 191.59   3.35   2.60  1.00  Look! Mila's apples are still on the grass!
  45 194.99   2.47   1.72  1.00  Mila, can I help you?
  46 197.51   1.72   1.17  1.00  Yes, please!
  47 199.28   6.59   3.64  1.00  Let's count the apples together! One, two, three, four, five!
  48 205.92   2.41   1.26  1.00  Thank you, Lily!
  49 208.38   4.35   3.60  1.00  Look! Leo's kite is still stuck. Leo, can I help you?
  50 212.78   6.72   2.17  1.00  How can they get the kite down? Hmm...
