  52 222.56   3.06   2.11  1.00  Boing! Boing! Leo can't reach it.
  53 225.67   4.29   3.54  1.00  Let's wait for the wind, and pull the string together, gently!
  54 230.01   3.58   2.63  1.00  One, two, three... pull! Gently, gently!
  55 233.64   4.06   3.11  1.00  The wind blows, and the kite floats free! Hooray!
  56 237.75   2.28   1.13  1.00  Thank you, Lily!
  57 240.08   3.37   2.62  1.00  And Bobo! Can I help you carry the box?
  58 243.50   5.32   4.37  1.00  Lily holds one side, Bobo holds the other. Heave, ho! Heave, ho!
  59 248.87   2.90   1.75  1.00  It's so light now! Thank you, Lily!
  60 251.82   5.28   4.33  1.00  Then all four friends build a castle together. The biggest castle ever!
  61 257.15   4.79   3.64  1.00  Helping my friends feels so good! My heart is happy!
  62 261.99   4.86   3.41  1.00  When we help our friends, everybody is happy, even us!
